---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import { caseStudies, conceptProjects } from "../../data/site";
---
<SiteLayout active="work" title="Selected work - Saad" description="Selected product engineering work and independent design concepts.">
  <header class="container page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Selected work</p><h1>Products, systems, and visual explorations.</h1><p>Production product work alongside independent landing-page concepts. Each page describes what is known, with no invented outcomes or client claims.</p></header>

  <section class="container section" aria-labelledby="concept-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Independent explorations</p><h2 id="concept-heading">Landing page concepts</h2></div><p>Captured directly from the live concept pages. Each project opens with desktop and mobile views.</p></div>
    <div class="concept-grid">
      {conceptProjects.map((project) => <article class="concept-card" data-reveal>
        <a class="concept-cover" href={`/work/${project.slug}/`} aria-label={`View ${project.name} concept case study`}>
          <img src={project.desktopImage} alt={`${project.name} landing page concept on desktop`} loading="lazy" width="1440" height="960" />
          <span class="concept-open">View case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
        </a>
        <div class="concept-card-copy"><div class="concept-title"><div><p class="project-group">{project.category} · Concept</p><h3><a href={`/work/${project.slug}/`}>{project.name}</a></h3></div><a class="live-link" href={project.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Live demo ↗</a></div>
          <p>{project.summary}</p><div class="tag-list"><span class="tag">Independent concept</span><span class="tag">Responsive web</span></div>
        </div>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section" aria-labelledby="product-heading">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Selected product work</p><h2 id="product-heading">Systems in use</h2></div><p>Summaries are based on project notes. Client identities, detailed roles, and approved visual assets are not available for every project.</p></div>
    <div class="project-grid">
      {caseStudies.map((project) => <article class="project project-tile" data-reveal>
        <span class="project-group">{project.group}</span>
        <div class="project-copy"><h3><a href={`/work/${project.slug}/`}>{project.name}</a></h3><p>{project.description}</p><div class="tag-list" aria-label="Technologies">{project.tags.map((tag) => <span class="tag">{tag}</span>)}</div></div>
        <a class="project-action text-link" href={`/work/${project.slug}/`}>Case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </article>)}
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container callout" data-reveal><h2>Working through a similar product challenge?</h2><a class="button" href="/contact/">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
</SiteLayout>
